WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.050
Your team says more in one call than it writes all week.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.300
A Mac app. No bot.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.300
Chinese and English, one transcript.
我们下周把数据管道切到新的调度器。
We move the data pipeline onto the new scheduler next week.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.900
Who knows whom.
Marco, worked with, Priya. 18:52, Platform planning.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.400
9 of 10 intros land when the name came up on a call.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.000
To do: Lin, send Marco the budget breakdown (04:41). Marco, write the rollback plan (04:26).

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.850
Ask your own AI.
"Who has offered us an intro to a payments team since August?"

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:22.000
Three people offered. Lin made the warmest one, in Mandarin, at 27:41.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.900
Don't like how it works? Fork it.
Change the prompts. Self-host.

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:27.000
It's all on Tape.

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.300
tape. Open source meeting memory.
